#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Background {#background}"
msgstr "Background {#background}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Amplitude amplification is a general-purpose quantum algorithm, or subroutine, that can be used to obtain a quadratic speedup over a handful of classical algorithms. [Grover's algorithm](https://arxiv.org/abs/quant-ph/9605043) was the first to demonstrate this speedup on unstructured search problems. Formulating a Grover's search problem requires an oracle function that marks one or more computational basis states as the states we are interested in finding, and an amplification circuit that increases the amplitude of marked states, consequently suppressing the remaining states.\n"
msgstr "Ang amplitude amplification ay isang pangkalahatang-layuning quantum algorithm, o subroutine, na maaaring gamitin upang makakuha ng quadratic speedup sa ilang classical algorithms. Ang [algorithm ni Grover](https://arxiv.org/abs/quant-ph/9605043) ang unang nagpakita ng speedup na ito sa mga unstructured search problems. Ang pagbuo ng Grover's search problem ay nangangailangan ng oracle function na nagmamarka ng isa o higit pang computational basis states bilang mga states na interesado tayong hanapin, at ng amplification circuit na nagpapataas ng amplitude ng mga markadong states, at dahil dito ay pinipigilan ang natitirang mga states.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Here, we demonstrate how to construct Grover oracles and use the [`grover_operator()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.grover_operator) from the Qiskit circuit library to easily set up a Grover's search instance. The runtime `Sampler` primitive allows seamless execution of Grover circuits.\n"
msgstr "Dito, ipapakita natin kung paano bumuo ng mga Grover oracle at gamitin ang [`grover_operator()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.grover_operator) mula sa Qiskit circuit library upang madaling mag-set up ng Grover's search instance. Ang runtime `Sampler` primitive ay nagbibigay-daan sa walang-sagabal na pagpapatupad ng mga Grover circuit.\n"

